ild to verify (own target dir):\n  cd /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ZHr7ad/translation && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$TMPDIR/tgt-cfg cargo build --release 2>&1 | grep -E \"error\" -A6 | head -60\nErrors in OTHER src/*.rs files are not your problem; errors mentioning src/config.rs\nor src/error.rs are. Iterate until there are none.\n\nAlso self-check the message tables: write a tiny throwaway C program that prints the\nC library's `pcre2_get_error_message` output for every error number from -80..250 using\n/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ZHr7ad/_cbuild/libpcre2.so (link with\n-L that dir -lpcre2 -Wl,-rpath,that dir and include c_src/include), and compare with the\nbytes you put in your Rust tables. Report any mismatch you found and fixed.\n\nReport: what you translated, the verification you did, and the final build status.","outputFile":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-agent-xpOsEx/tmp/claude-31072124/-local-home-scheschb--harvest-work-harvest-work-ZHr7ad/6b19aa16-17c8-42f3-a300-59c20a915dbc/tasks/ad1fa5a7f21559707.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
