ement/condition, exactly as C does.\n- `PCRE2_ASSERT` / `PCRE2_DEBUG_UNREACHABLE` are kept as comments only; the `#ifdef PCRE2_DEBUG` line `args->header.type = CDATA_RECURSE_ARGS;` is omitted, matching the build config.\n- `args->size = (size_t)(captures - (uint16_t*)(args + 1))` is computed as a byte difference divided by `size_of::<u16>()`, which is the same value.\n\nresult: pcre2_compile_cgroup.c fully translated to /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ZHr7ad/translation/src/compile_cgroup.rs (6 exported + 2 static fns + local memcmp/hash helpers); crate builds with zero errors or warnings for that file and no changes to any other file.","usage":{"total_tokens":49400,"tool_uses":12,"duration_ms":170273},"uuid":"15b290b0-0cc1-409c-a586-722f410401ca","session_id":"6b19aa16-17c8-42f3-a300-59c20a915dbc"}
