{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_2lrb3lmbnifmnxhbkaouzmbv6n2o7wsaz5mdbqvuq3s5pls23vrq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Done.** The complete PCRE2 10.48-DEV library (8-bit, LINK_SIZE 2, SUPPORT_UNICODE, no JIT) is translated to Rust in `translation/` — 52,766 lines across 35 modules — and verified to be behaviorally identical to the C build.\n\n## Completion gate: symbol parity\n\n```\nC symbols: 143   Rust symbols: 143\nmissing in Rust: (none)\nextra in Rust:   (none)\n```\n\nAll 143 exports reproduced under their final linker names, including macro-generated ones (`pcre2_compile_8`, `_pcre2_check_escape_8`, `_pcre2_compile_add_name_to_table8` — note no `_` before the `8` — `_pcre2_utf8_table1` with no suffix, `_pcre2_posix_class_maps8`, the three `static mut` default contexts, and all 25 UCD/table data symbols).\n\n## Verification (all differential vs. the real `libpcre2.so`)\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| ABI struct layouts (21 structs + key `offsetof`s, incl. `heapframe`, `compile_block`, `match_block`) | **identical** |\n| 1,202 constants vs. C preprocessor (opcodes, META, ESC, ERR, ucp, PT/XCL/ECL…) | **0 mismatches** |\n| 25 exported data tables byte-compared via `dlopen` (UCD records/stages, `utt`, chartables…) | **identical** |\n| Leaf internals fuzzed via `dlopen` (`ord2utf`, `valid_utf` ×200k, `script_run`, `is_newline`, `ckd_smul`, `extuni`) | **identical** |\n| Curated API harness: 122 patterns × 22 compile-option sets × 27 subjects × 9 match options, match+DFA+substitute+substring+serialize+convert+callouts+`pattern_info` | **byte-identical, 2,576,785 lines** |\n| Randomized harness (deterministic RNG, 14 seeds, ~20M lines on the largest run) | **byte-identical** |\n| Stress/edge harness: match/depth/heap-limit failures (-47/-53/-63), DFA workspace (-43), partial+restart, recursion loops, 200 KB subjects, invalid UTF, custom allocators (**allocation count and byte totals m